  <name>Isomar</name>
  <summary>Chart plotter for sailors</summary>
  <developer id="eu.6px">
    <name>Jonathan Foucher</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Isomar is a chart plotter for sailors: nautical charts (S-57 vector and BSB raster), routes and
      waypoints, instruments from NMEA, AIS and Signal K, tides, weather forecasts and weather routing.
    </p>
    <p>
      It ships an open-data planning chart that is not for navigation, and reads the charts you have
      licensed yourself.
    </p>
  </description>
